# Generated files and templates are written to users' projects and servers by Dango and read
# by Linux tools (shell, Docker, nginx, dbt, YAML/TOML parsers): check them out with LF on
# every platform, including Windows. A narrow set (not `* text=auto eol=lf`) keeps files that
# are committed with CRLF today unchanged, so no renormalization is needed.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.j2 text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
dango/templates/** text eol=lf
